      "content": "This maps wallpaper values to labels a second time. `MainPage.wallpaper()` already has the same value→label list, and it keeps `\"reddit\"` in a private `REDDIT` constant. If a source is added or renamed in only one place, the rail summary and the Look page will show different names, and the summary will quietly fall back to \"Daily\". Put the wallpaper `Option` list (or at least the value constants) in one shared place and use it in both files.",
